rts, and sorting is\ninjective on multisets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.partitionShape_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.partitionShape_card","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedPartitionShape.lean#L84-L89","doc":"**A partition's shape has `n` cells.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sort_coe_of_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sort_coe_of_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedPartitionShape.lean#L75-L80","doc":"Sorting an already-sorted list returns it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.card_cells_eq_rowLens_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.card_cells_eq_rowLens_sum","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedPartitionShape.lean#L70-L73","doc":"A diagram's cell count is the sum of its own row lengths. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.card_cells_ofRowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.card_cells_ofRowLens","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedPartitionShape.lean#L57-L68","doc":"**A Young diagram has as many cells as its row lengths sum to.** The cells are the disjoint\nunion of the rows, and a row is a singleton times a range. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_range_getD_nat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_range_getD_nat","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedPartitionShape.lean#L48-L55","doc":"Indexed sum over a list's positions is its sum. ","signatureChunk":0}]}